---
// Container memory layer cake: Container Limit -> Working Set / RSS -> Go HeapSys -> HeapInuse -> HeapAlloc.
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="ge6b">
  <div class="ge6b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Nested comparison of Go runtime memory metrics inside OS RSS and container limits, showing why HeapAlloc sits inside HeapInuse which sits inside HeapSys and container Working Set.">
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="258" rx="10" class="ge6b-outer" />
      <text x="30" y="38" class="ge6b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Container OOM Kill Limit (cgroup memory.max) — measured by Kernel cgroup controller</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trần OOM Container (cgroup memory.max) — Kernel Linux đếm cả page cache ẩn danh</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* OS Working Set */}
      <rect x="30" y="50" width="840" height="206" rx="8" class="ge6b-rss" />
      <text x="46" y="74" class="ge6b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>container_memory_working_set_bytes / OS RSS — includes code, stacks, mmap &amp; Go runtime</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>OS RSS / Working Set — gồm mã máy, stack goroutine, mmap ngoài và toàn bộ vùng nhớ Go</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* HeapSys */}
      <rect x="46" y="88" width="600" height="152" rx="8" class="ge6b-sys" />
      <text x="62" y="110" class="ge6b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>go_memstats_heap_sys_bytes (Heap reserved by Go runtime)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>go_memstats_heap_sys_bytes (Tổng vùng heap Go xin giữ từ OS)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* HeapInuse */}
      <rect x="62" y="124" width="388" height="100" rx="6" class="ge6b-inuse" />
      <text x="76" y="146" class="ge6b-b-ok">HeapInuse (spans in use)</text>

      {/* HeapAlloc */}
      <rect x="76" y="158" width="220" height="52" rx="5" class="ge6b-alloc" />
      <text x="88" y="180" class="ge6b-b">HeapAlloc (Live bytes)</text>
      <text x="88" y="198" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Matches pprof inuse_space</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp sát pprof inuse_space</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Gap inside HeapInuse */}
      <text x="306" y="180" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fragmented /</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô trống trong span</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="306" y="196" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>uncollected tail</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hoặc rác chờ quét</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* HeapIdle + HeapReleased */}
      <rect x="462" y="124" width="168" height="100" rx="6" class="ge6b-idle" />
      <text x="474" y="146" class="ge6b-b">HeapIdle</text>
      <text x="474" y="166" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Free spans waiting;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Span rỗi; phần đã trả</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="182" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>HeapReleased returned</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>qua MADV_DONTNEED</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="198" class="ge6b-m">via MADV_DONTNEED</text>

      {/* Right column: Non-heap / Trap */}
      <rect x="662" y="88" width="192" height="152" rx="8" class="ge6b-nonheap" />
      <text x="676" y="112" class="ge6b-b-red">Off-Heap &amp; Traps</text>
      <text x="676" y="134" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Goroutine stacks</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Stack các goroutine</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="152" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Cgo / explicit mmap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Cgo &amp; mmap gọi riêng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="170" class="ge6b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• File page cache</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Đệm file hệ điều hành</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="196" class="ge6b-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>HeapAlloc = 50 MB yet</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>HeapAlloc nhỏ xíu nhưng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="214" class="ge6b-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>OOM can still hit RSS!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>pod vẫn chết OOM vì RSS!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Track memory from both sides: container working-set RSS warns you before Kubernetes OOM kills happen, while Go HeapInuse vs. HeapAlloc tells you whether Go objects or off-heap stacks/cgo/mmaps hold the RAM.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Luôn soi RAM từ hai phía: chỉ số Working Set của container báo trước nguy cơ OOMKill trên Kubernetes, còn HeapInuse với HeapAlloc trong Go cho biết rác đang kẹt trong heap hay ở stack/cgo bên ngoài.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge6b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge6b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge6b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge6b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge6b-outer { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
  .ge6b-rss { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ge6b-sys { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge6b-inuse { fill: var(--bg); stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6b-inuse { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6b-alloc { fill: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.14); stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6b-alloc { fill: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.14); stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6b-idle { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .ge6b-nonheap { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge6b-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge6b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge6b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge6b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge6b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
